## Technical Architecture

### System Components

#### Frontend
- **Web Application**: React.js with TypeScript and Redux
- **Mobile Apps**: Native iOS (Swift) and Android (Kotlin) applications
- **Desktop Application**: Electron-based desktop application
- **Charting Library**: TradingView or similar advanced charting solution

#### Backend
- **Core Services**: Node.js with TypeScript and NestJS
- **Order Management**: High-performance order matching engine
- **Risk Management**: Real-time risk calculation and monitoring
- **Market Data**: Real-time market data distribution system
- **Analytics Engine**: Big data analytics for performance reporting

#### Database
- **Transactional Database**: PostgreSQL for ACID-compliant transactions
- **Time-Series Database**: InfluxDB for market data and analytics
- **Cache Layer**: Redis for high-speed data access
- **Document Storage**: MongoDB for unstructured data

#### Infrastructure
- **Cloud Platform**: AWS or Google Cloud Platform
- **Containerization**: Docker for application containerization
- **Orchestration**: Kubernetes for container orchestration
- **Message Queue**: Apache Kafka for real-time data streaming
- **Load Balancing**: NGINX or cloud load balancer

