## API Endpoints

### Authentication
- `POST /api/auth/register` - User registration
- `POST /api/auth/login` - User login with MFA
- `POST /api/auth/logout` - User logout
- `POST /api/auth/refresh` - Refresh authentication token

### User Management
- `GET /api/users/profile` - Get user profile
- `PUT /api/users/profile` - Update user profile
- `POST /api/users/documents` - Upload user documents
- `GET /api/users/documents` - List user documents

### Account Management
- `GET /api/accounts` - List user accounts
- `GET /api/accounts/{id}` - Get account details
- `POST /api/accounts` - Create new account
- `PUT /api/accounts/{id}` - Update account settings

### Market Data
- `GET /api/market/instruments` - List available instruments
- `GET /api/market/instruments/{symbol}` - Get instrument details
- `GET /api/market/quotes/{symbol}` - Get real-time quote
- `GET /api/market/history/{symbol}` - Get historical data

### Order Management
- `GET /api/orders` - List orders with filtering
- `GET /api/orders/{id}` - Get order details
- `POST /api/orders` - Place new order
- `DELETE /api/orders/{id}` - Cancel order
- `PUT /api/orders/{id}` - Modify existing order

### Portfolio Management
- `GET /api/portfolio/positions` - Get portfolio positions
- `GET /api/portfolio/history` - Get portfolio history
- `GET /api/portfolio/performance` - Get portfolio performance
- `GET /api/portfolio/analytics` - Get portfolio analytics

### Reporting
- `GET /api/reports/transactions` - Get transaction history
- `GET /api/reports/tax` - Get tax reporting data
- `GET /api/reports/performance` - Get performance reports
- `POST /api/reports/custom` - Generate custom reports

